('split_review: The complete azo route and complete triphenylmethane route remain independently assessable reaction sequences. The explicit BY source supports both content components, while their conjunction does not make one atomic mastery decision. My prior sealed non_atomic finding remains unchanged.', '4fb9f93d', 'The source explicitly requires both complete syntheses at particle/mechanism level. Source fit supports the two components; it supplies no atomicity waiver or merged-competence clearance.', 'Die lernende Person bearbeitet geänderte Partner bzw. Substituenten in beiden Syntheserouten jeweils mit eigener vollständiger mechanistischer Begründung.', 'For changed partners or substituents, the learner supplies a separate complete mechanistic explanation for each synthesis route.', 'Both designed cases are chemically assessable: diazotisation conserves N/O/H and charge, followed by azo-coupling sigma complex/deprotonation; the other route uses carbonyl activation, aryl attacks, water loss and leuco oxidation with balanced H+/electrons. Changed protonation and R substituent are substantive. Design Pass cannot clear the independent non_atomic decision.'),
