('The body includes researched everyday and health judgments for selected dyes. DE/EN agree; a supplied summary is not actual independent source research or proof of safety.', '3407ef25,d7b37a3d', 'The BY everyday/research component and explicit LK health-comparison component are separately supported. The first BY GK row alone does not authorise the health comparison for GK or clear the whole scope union.', 'Die lernende Person prüft eine neue Stoff-/Anwendungsquelle und unterscheidet orale von dermaler Exposition sowie belegte Daten von Werbeaussagen.', 'The learner checks a fresh substance/use source and distinguishes oral from dermal exposure and evidence from promotional claims.', 'The tasks require actual source lookup with recorded identity, context and uncertainty; author summaries alone cannot earn research credit. Equal colour/fastness is not equal toxicology. EFSA’s actual food-colour and additive pages were checked for the bounded function/safety-assessment statements. Oral food evaluation does not establish textile/dermal safety.'),
